<title>AUSTRALIA: Port conditions update - Australia - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Australia - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>NEWCASTLE, June 19 - Port reopened fully 0930 Thursday.</p>
<p>GOVE, June 19 - Reopened fully about 1130 on Wednesday.</p>
